# Rebuilt by the scripts in scripts/ -- the raw + organised dataset, the
# cached CLIP features, and the smoke-test throwaways. checkpoints/full.pt
# and results/ ARE committed: they are small and they are the deliverables.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Unanchored, `data/` and `features/` also
# match `src/data/` and `src/features/`, which silently kept five source files
# out of the repo and left every clone unable to import the package.
